        "rationale": "Every pull_request/push workflow got a deliberate decision (tests, deploy, docs-site changed; nightly-sweep and triage explicitly left alone with reasons), and the required `unit-tests` check is a single workflow with no workflow-level paths or paths-ignore that gates setup-node, npm ci and npm test behind a computed `steps.changes.outputs.run` `if:`; the one small gap is the acknowledged weakness of the HEAD^1 diff on multi-commit fast-forward pushes."
